# #1145 single-threaded control: the arming lock must not change an ANSWER.
# Both tiers, read back through the forms that consult them.
x is 1.0
x is 2.0
x is 3.0
print of f"PREV {prev of x}"
q is 1
q is 2
q is 3
print of f"WHEN1 {what is q when 1}"
print of f"WHEN2 {what is q when 2}"
print of f"NOW {q}"
